# Check every text file out with LF, on every platform. Windows git defaults
# to core.autocrlf=true, which rewrites line endings at checkout -- that
# silently changes the bytes of files whose byte-identity we assert
# (docs/SHARED_MODELS_CONTRACT.md is pinned by hash) and would make the same
# source tree hash differently on Windows than on macOS.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never line-ending-convert these, regardless of content sniffing.
*.icns binary
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.woff2 binary
